# L §5.14 (tally 2.3, #247; review of G1, B1): a decision whose day is a hole is never walked, and is a member
# of a binding over its kind with its hole: "a movement whose day is a hole makes every flows and binding over a
# span it might fall in a hole", every span (no bound). Before: 0 and 0.00 PLN, where every pinned day gives 1.
=== m.tally
model d1
  tally 2
  on 2026-04-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
source card "invented"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind sweeps: event certain
  leg cash: PLN
place sav: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input pay: money PLN
input dd: date
move sweep: sweeps
  on dd
  reads sav
  leg cash from sav to world amount min(bal(sav), pay)
version v_card
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  pay = 100.00 PLN "c"
  dd = ?"which day is the sweep?" "c"
  opening[sav] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "c"
ask n: count(t in sweeps over 2026-05)
ask n_p5: count(t in sweeps over 2026-05) with dd = 2026-05-05
ask s: sum(t.cash.amount for t in sweeps over 2026-05)
ask s_p5: sum(t.cash.amount for t in sweeps over 2026-05) with dd = 2026-05-05
ask n_jan: count(t in sweeps over 2026-01)
=== expect
n: ?"which day is the sweep?" (dd)
  cut 2026-04-20
n_jan: ?"which day is the sweep?" (dd)
  cut 2026-04-20
n_p5: 1
  pinned: dd = 2026-05-05
  cut 2026-04-20
s: ?"which day is the sweep?" (dd)
  cut 2026-04-20
s_p5: 100.00 PLN
  pinned: dd = 2026-05-05
  cut 2026-04-20
